{"seq":3,"slug":"industrial-automation","title":"工业自动化系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/industrial-automation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"plc-and-programming","title":"大学自动化 — PLC 与工业编程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/industrial-automation/plc-and-programming","wordCount":1628,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"scada-and-dcs","title":"大学自动化 — SCADA 与分布式控制系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/industrial-automation/scada-and-dcs","wordCount":1641,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"industrial-networks","title":"大学自动化 — 工业网络与现场总线","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/automation/industrial-automation/industrial-networks","wordCount":1745,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"工业自动化系统\">工业自动化系统</h1><p>理论和元件最终要汇聚成真实工厂里运转的大系统。一条现代生产线可能有上千个传感器、数百台电机，它们必须被统一编程、协同动作、实时监控——这正是工业自动化系统要解决的问题。</p>\n<p>本章介绍工业现场的三大主角：负责逻辑控制的 PLC、负责全厂监控的 SCADA/DCS，以及把它们连成一张网络的现场总线与工业以太网，帮你建立起对&quot;工厂自动化骨架&quot;的整体认识。</p>\n"}